 "_doc": "What kind of thing each enemy is, and which fights are made of people. Ours, not the original game's — tools/build-emberveil-data.mjs never touches this file. A toll on the road is collected by somebody with hands, so the toll and bandit events, and the crossings that end in a brawl, pick a fight from `roadBands` (or a humanoid encounter already in the zone's pool) instead of whatever happens to haunt the zone. Before this, a bandit demanding a toll on the Dust Roads could summon four cinder hounds.",
